## How to commit

**Shared artifacts (specs, constitution, docs):**
```bash
git add . && git commit -m "..." && git push
# Run from workspace root
```

**Per-repository changes:**
```bash
cd {{SUB_REPO}} && git add . && git commit -m "..." && git push
```

