## Developer setup

Required environment variables (add to ~/.zshrc):
```bash
export APIDOG_ACCESS_TOKEN="..."
export FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN="..."
export GITHUB_TOKEN="..."
export TRELLO_API_KEY="..."
export TRELLO_TOKEN="..."
```

After setting: `source ~/.zshrc` then restart Claude Code.

Full setup guide: https://github.com/{{GITHUB_OWNER}}/workspace-bootstrap-kit

## Spec-driven loop

Every feature:
  1. /speckit.specify → /speckit.clarify → /speckit.plan → /speckit.tasks
  2. Apidog: create new endpoints, retrieve shareable URLs
  3. Trello: create cards in Backlog with Apidog/Figma links and labels
  4. /speckit.implement

Never implement without a spec, plan, Apidog endpoints, and Trello cards.

